#### the period after the last full one takes the remainder to salvage

- Verify: the period after the last full one takes the remainder to salvage


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: the period after the last full one takes the remainder to salvage")
